      "review_summary": "This PR adds non-mutating Policy doctor preview repairs for two review-required Gateway findings, preserves skipped repair changes in the shared doctor repair flow, and documents the behavior.\n\nPR surface: Source +153, Tests +122, Docs +7. Total +282 across 6 files.\n\nReproducibility: not applicable. This PR adds preview behavior rather than fixing a reproduced bug. The discussion provides source-runner proof for the intended Gateway preview path at the reviewed head.",
